#: ../../source/minecraft-modpack-server_SKILL.md:7
msgid "Minecraft Modpack Server Setup"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/minecraft-modpack-server_SKILL.md:9
msgid "When to use"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/minecraft-modpack-server_SKILL.md:10
msgid "User wants to set up a modded Minecraft server from a server pack zip"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/minecraft-modpack-server_SKILL.md:11
msgid "User needs help with NeoForge/Forge server configuration"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/minecraft-modpack-server_SKILL.md:12
msgid "User asks about Minecraft server performance tuning or backups"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/minecraft-modpack-server_SKILL.md:14
msgid "Gather User Preferences First"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/minecraft-modpack-server_SKILL.md:15
msgid "Before starting setup, ask the user for:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/minecraft-modpack-server_SKILL.md:16
msgid "**Server name / MOTD** — what should it say in the server list?"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/minecraft-modpack-server_SKILL.md:17
msgid "**Seed** — specific seed or random?"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/minecraft-modpack-server_SKILL.md:18
msgid "**Difficulty** — peaceful / easy / normal / hard?"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/minecraft-modpack-server_SKILL.md:19
msgid "**Gamemode** — survival / creative / adventure?"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/minecraft-modpack-server_SKILL.md:20
msgid ""
"**Online mode** — true (Mojang auth, legit accounts) or false "
"(LAN/cracked friendly)?"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/minecraft-modpack-server_SKILL.md:21
msgid ""
"**Player count** — how many players expected? (affects RAM & view "
"distance tuning)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/minecraft-modpack-server_SKILL.md:22
msgid ""
"**RAM allocation** — or let agent decide based on mod count & available "
"RAM?"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/minecraft-modpack-server_SKILL.md:23
msgid ""
"**View distance / simulation distance** — or let agent pick based on "
"player count & hardware?"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/minecraft-modpack-server_SKILL.md:24
msgid "**PvP** — on or off?"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/minecraft-modpack-server_SKILL.md:25
msgid "**Whitelist** — open server or whitelist only?"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/minecraft-modpack-server_SKILL.md:26
msgid "**Backups** — want automated backups? How often?"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/minecraft-modpack-server_SKILL.md:28
msgid ""
"Use sensible defaults if the user doesn't care, but always ask before "
"generating the config."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/minecraft-modpack-server_SKILL.md:30
msgid "Steps"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/minecraft-modpack-server_SKILL.md:32
msgid "1. Download & Inspect the Pack"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/minecraft-modpack-server_SKILL.md:40
msgid ""
"Look for: `startserver.sh`, installer jar (neoforge/forge), "
"`user_jvm_args.txt`, `mods/` folder. Check the script to determine: mod "
"loader type, version, and required Java version."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/minecraft-modpack-server_SKILL.md:43
msgid "2. Install Java"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/minecraft-modpack-server_SKILL.md:44
msgid "Minecraft 1.21+ → Java 21: `sudo apt install openjdk-21-jre-headless`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/minecraft-modpack-server_SKILL.md:45
msgid "Minecraft 1.18-1.20 → Java 17: `sudo apt install openjdk-17-jre-headless`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/minecraft-modpack-server_SKILL.md:46
msgid ""
"Minecraft 1.16 and below → Java 8: `sudo apt install openjdk-8-jre-"
"headless`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/minecraft-modpack-server_SKILL.md:47
msgid "Verify: `java -version`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/minecraft-modpack-server_SKILL.md:49
msgid "3. Install the Mod Loader"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/minecraft-modpack-server_SKILL.md:50
msgid ""
"Most server packs include an install script. Use the INSTALL_ONLY env var"
" to install without launching:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/minecraft-modpack-server_SKILL.md:57
msgid "This downloads libraries, patches the server jar, etc."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/minecraft-modpack-server_SKILL.md:59
msgid "4. Accept EULA"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/minecraft-modpack-server_SKILL.md:64
msgid "5. Configure server.properties"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/minecraft-modpack-server_SKILL.md:65
msgid "Key settings for modded/LAN:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/minecraft-modpack-server_SKILL.md:78
msgid "Performance settings (scale to hardware):"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/minecraft-modpack-server_SKILL.md:93
msgid "6. Tune JVM Args (user_jvm_args.txt)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/minecraft-modpack-server_SKILL.md:94
msgid "Scale RAM to player count and mod count. Rule of thumb for modded:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/minecraft-modpack-server_SKILL.md:95
msgid "100-200 mods: 6-12GB"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/minecraft-modpack-server_SKILL.md:96
msgid "200-350+ mods: 12-24GB"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/minecraft-modpack-server_SKILL.md:97
msgid "Leave at least 8GB free for the OS/other tasks"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/minecraft-modpack-server_SKILL.md:122
msgid "7. Open Firewall"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/minecraft-modpack-server_SKILL.md:126
msgid "Check with: `sudo ufw status | grep 25565`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/minecraft-modpack-server_SKILL.md:128
msgid "8. Create Launch Script"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/minecraft-modpack-server_SKILL.md:137
msgid ""
"Note: For Forge (not NeoForge), the args file path differs. Check "
"`startserver.sh` for the exact path."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/minecraft-modpack-server_SKILL.md:139
msgid "9. Set Up Automated Backups"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/minecraft-modpack-server_SKILL.md:140
msgid "Create backup script:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/minecraft-modpack-server_SKILL.md:167
msgid "Add hourly cron:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/minecraft-modpack-server_SKILL.md:172
msgid "Pitfalls"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/minecraft-modpack-server_SKILL.md:173
msgid ""
"ALWAYS set `allow-flight=true` for modded — mods with jetpacks/flight "
"will kick players otherwise"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/minecraft-modpack-server_SKILL.md:174
msgid ""
"`max-tick-time=180000` or higher — modded servers often have long ticks "
"during worldgen"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/minecraft-modpack-server_SKILL.md:175
msgid "First startup is SLOW (several minutes for big packs) — don't panic"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/minecraft-modpack-server_SKILL.md:176
msgid ""
"\"Can't keep up!\" warnings on first launch are normal, settles after "
"initial chunk gen"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/minecraft-modpack-server_SKILL.md:177
msgid ""
"If online-mode=false, set enforce-secure-profile=false too or clients get"
" rejected"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/minecraft-modpack-server_SKILL.md:178
msgid ""
"The pack's startserver.sh often has an auto-restart loop — make a clean "
"launch script without it"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/minecraft-modpack-server_SKILL.md:179
msgid "Delete the world/ folder to regenerate with a new seed"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/minecraft-modpack-server_SKILL.md:180
msgid ""
"Some packs have env vars to control behavior (e.g., ATM10 uses "
"ATM10_JAVA, ATM10_RESTART, ATM10_INSTALL_ONLY)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/minecraft-modpack-server_SKILL.md:182
msgid "Verification"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/minecraft-modpack-server_SKILL.md:183
msgid "`pgrep -fa neoforge` or `pgrep -fa minecraft` to check if running"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/minecraft-modpack-server_SKILL.md:184
msgid "Check logs: `tail -f ~/minecraft-server/server/logs/latest.log`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/minecraft-modpack-server_SKILL.md:185
msgid "Look for \"Done (Xs)!\" in the log = server is ready"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/minecraft-modpack-server_SKILL.md:186
msgid "Test connection: player adds server IP in Multiplayer"
msgstr ""

